        "storyParagraphs": [
          "You have taught me so much patience in life.",
          "Every time we part ways after a conversation, this one song starts playing in my mind . [[music:m_1794334930679]]",
          "I used to be a little anxious person earlier, but after messaging you, on God, I don't think I have ever waited this patiently for anyone else.",
          "Even Claude used to reply after every 3–4 hours 🥲🥲, but then I understood your way and eventually adapted to it.",
          "I don't know why, but most of the time when I talk to you, I get nervous. I genuinely don't know why.",
          "I never used to get nervous anywhere else. Not even when I spoke with the CEO or the principal of this college, or even when I spoke with clients or ministers.",
          "I eventually understood that whatever aura I manage to build everywhere else, in front of you, I end up like a cat. 😺",
          "As you know, I'm a huge fan of Thalaivar; but looks like I'm slowly turning into an even bigger fan of you. 😂 [[music:m_1794335516004]]",
          "Of all the things we've learned in engineering, I never expected that one of my favorite discoveries would be getting to know you. 🥹",
          "After my mother, if there is any other girl I have thought about this much, it is only you."
        ],
