        "chapterNumber": "Chapter III (Cont.) ♡",
        "chapterTitle": "Promises for Tomorrow",
        "dateOrLocation": "22 August",
        "decorativeInitial": "",
        "storyParagraphs": [
          "And I know I'm not a perfect person. But I'm not trying to become someone perfect. I'm willing to keep improving my imperfections and become someone better.",
          "I can't promise to solve all your problems, but I can promise that you won't have to face them alone. 🤞",
          "Today, I might not be someone who is successful or has achieved everything I dream of. But I genuinely believe and trust that tomorrow, I'll become someone I'm truly proud of.",
          "I'll make sure I achieve the things I want in life, and I think you should be there too.",
          "I'm usually a very busy person; but this busy person always wants to spare some time for you. [[music:m_1794341188349]]",
          "I know this is unusual and might even be overwhelming, but I just felt like telling you everything about what you mean to me.",
          "And I also know that this isn't an easy thing to process.",
          "Take your sweet time. I'll be here, just as you have taught me to become patient enough."
        ],
        "signature": "— Arjun ♡",
